 "answer_verbatim": "There isn’t one objectively “best” AI marketing agency in Los Angeles—it depends on whether you need AI-powered campaign execution, AI-search visibility, or broader digital marketing.\n\n**For a general-purpose starting point, I’d shortlist Thrive Internet Marketing Agency.** It offers a broad mix of SEO, paid media, and AI-visibility services, and its published case studies report measurable growth. **For a more specialized focus on getting a brand cited in AI-generated answers**, Emarketed is another option; it reports a client increase in AI mentions, though that result is self-reported.\n\nBefore choosing, ask each agency for recent results from clients like yours, exactly what it uses AI for, who reviews the work, and how success is measured. Treat agency rankings and case-study claims as leads to verify, not independent proof.",
